Generated assets
  Every file under site/assets/ and site/public/ was generated for this repository and is distributed under
  the repository licence (Apache-2.0). The emblem and sheet glyphs are original line art drafted by an OpenAI
  Codex agent and redrawn as geometry; site/public/favicon.svg, favicon-32.png, apple-touch-icon.png and
  icon-512.png are rendered from site/assets/emblem.svg. The plates and the social card are rendered by the
  scripts in scripts/assets/ from the sources above, from aggregator/data/region-coords.json (triangulation
  in art-survey-plate.webp) and from the bundled Hepta Slab and Public Sans fonts (og-card.png). No shipped
  pixel comes from an image model.

Data sources
  - GitHub /meta endpoint (https://api.github.com/meta): published GitHub Actions and service CIDR ranges,
    used to match observed network addresses to cloud regions. IP addresses are never stored.
  - Azure service tags, AWS ip-ranges.json and GitHub /meta, used to curate collector/data/region-cidrs.json
    (region CIDR table; see SPEC 3.4).
  - Azure and AWS region names and city-level coordinates in aggregator/data/region-coords.json are
    curated from the providers' public region information.
  - Cloudflare trace endpoint (https://1.1.1.1/cdn-cgi/trace): read in memory for the egress IP when the
    Azure instance metadata service is unreachable (D-011). The IP is never stored.
